#: ../../library/os.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`os` --- basic \"operating system\" services"
msgstr ":mod:`os` --- layanan \"sistem operasi\" dasar"

#: ../../library/os.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``os`` module contains functions for filesystem access and mounting, "
"terminal redirection and duplication, and the ``uname`` and ``urandom`` "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``os`` berisi fungsi-fungsi untuk akses dan pemasangan filesystem, "
"pengalihan dan duplikasi terminal, serta fungsi ``uname`` dan ``urandom``\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/os.rst:12
msgid "General functions"
msgstr "Fungsi umum"

#: ../../library/os.rst:16
msgid ""
"Return a tuple (possibly a named tuple) containing information about the "
"underlying machine and/or its operating system.  The tuple has five fields "
"in the following order, each of them being a string:"
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan tuple (mungkin named tuple) yang berisi informasi tentang "
"mesin dasar dan/atau sistem operasinya. Tuple memiliki lima bidang dalam "
"urutan berikut, masing-masing berupa string:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:20
msgid "``sysname`` -- The name of the underlying system"
msgstr "``sysname`` -- Nama sistem dasar"

#: ../../library/os.rst:21
msgid "``nodename`` -- The network name (can be the same as ``sysname``)"
msgstr "``nodename`` -- Nama jaringan (dapat sama dengan ``sysname``\\ )"

#: ../../library/os.rst:22
msgid "``release`` -- The version of the underlying system"
msgstr "``release`` -- Versi sistem dasar"

#: ../../library/os.rst:23
msgid "``version`` -- The MicroPython version and build date"
msgstr "``version`` -- Versi MicroPython dan tanggal build"

#: ../../library/os.rst:24
msgid ""
"``machine`` -- An identifier for the underlying hardware (e.g. board, CPU)"
msgstr ""
"``machine`` -- Pengenal untuk perangkat keras dasar (misalnya board, CPU)"

#: ../../library/os.rst:28
msgid ""
"Return a bytes object with *n* random bytes. The source is cryptographically"
" suitable on every supported cam, though the implementation varies by port:"
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan objek bytes dengan *n* byte acak. Sumbernya secara "
"kriptografis sesuai pada setiap kamera yang didukung, meskipun "
"implementasinya bervariasi menurut port:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:32
msgid ""
"**STM32 cams** (M4, M7, H7, H7+, PT, N6) use the STM32 hardware RNG "
"peripheral."
msgstr ""
"**Kamera STM32** (M4, M7, H7, H7+, PT, N6) menggunakan periferal RNG "
"perangkat keras STM32."

#: ../../library/os.rst:34
msgid "**i.MX RT1062 cams** (RT1060) use the chip's hardware TRNG."
msgstr ""
"**Kamera i.MX RT1062** (RT1060) menggunakan TRNG perangkat keras chip."

#: ../../library/os.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Alif Ensemble cams** (AE3) use the Secure Enclave's hardware random "
"service."
msgstr ""
"**Kamera Alif Ensemble** (AE3) menggunakan layanan acak perangkat keras "
"Secure Enclave."

#: ../../library/os.rst:37
msgid "**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** uses the nRF52 hardware RNG peripheral."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** menggunakan periferal RNG perangkat keras "
"nRF52."

#: ../../library/os.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect** has no hardware TRNG; the pico-sdk PRNG is "
"seeded and continuously re-mixed with the RP2040's on-chip entropy sources."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect** tidak memiliki TRNG perangkat keras; PRNG "
"pico-sdk di-seed dan terus-menerus dicampur ulang dengan sumber entropi on-"
"chip RP2040."

#: ../../library/os.rst:44
msgid "Filesystem access"
msgstr "Akses filesystem"

#: ../../library/os.rst:48
msgid "Change current directory."
msgstr "Mengubah direktori saat ini."

#: ../../library/os.rst:52
msgid "Get the current directory."
msgstr "Mendapatkan direktori saat ini."

#: ../../library/os.rst:56
msgid ""
"This function returns an iterator which then yields tuples corresponding to "
"the entries in the directory that it is listing.  With no argument it lists "
"the current directory, otherwise it lists the directory given by *dir*."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini mengembalikan iterator yang kemudian menghasilkan tuple yang "
"sesuai dengan entri dalam direktori yang tercantum. Tanpa argumen, ia "
"mencantumkan direktori saat ini, jika tidak, ia mencantumkan direktori yang "
"diberikan oleh *dir*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:60
msgid "The tuples have the form *(name, type, inode[, size])*:"
msgstr "Tuple memiliki bentuk *(name, type, inode[, size])*\\ :"

#: ../../library/os.rst:62
msgid ""
"*name* is a string (or bytes if *dir* is a bytes object) and is the name of "
"the entry;"
msgstr ""
"*name* adalah string (atau bytes jika *dir* adalah objek bytes) dan "
"merupakan nama entri;"

#: ../../library/os.rst:64
msgid ""
"*type* is an integer that specifies the type of the entry, with 0x4000 for "
"directories and 0x8000 for regular files;"
msgstr ""
"*type* adalah bilangan bulat yang menentukan jenis entri, dengan 0x4000 "
"untuk direktori dan 0x8000 untuk file biasa;"

#: ../../library/os.rst:66
msgid ""
"*inode* is an integer corresponding to the inode of the file, and may be 0 "
"for filesystems that don't have such a notion."
msgstr ""
"*inode* adalah bilangan bulat yang sesuai dengan inode file, dan mungkin 0 "
"untuk filesystem yang tidak memiliki konsep tersebut."

#: ../../library/os.rst:68
msgid ""
"*size* is an integer that may be included depending on the filesystem type. "
"For file entries, *size* represents the size of the file or -1 if unknown. "
"Its meaning is currently undefined for directory entries."
msgstr ""
"*size* adalah bilangan bulat yang mungkin disertakan tergantung pada jenis "
"filesystem. Untuk entri file, *size* mewakili ukuran file atau -1 jika tidak"
" diketahui. Maknanya saat ini tidak ditentukan untuk entri direktori."

#: ../../library/os.rst:74
msgid ""
"With no argument, list the current directory.  Otherwise list the given "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Tanpa argumen, mencantumkan direktori saat ini. Jika tidak, mencantumkan "
"direktori yang diberikan."

#: ../../library/os.rst:78
msgid "Create a new directory."
msgstr "Membuat direktori baru."

#: ../../library/os.rst:82
msgid "Remove a file."
msgstr "Menghapus file."

#: ../../library/os.rst:86
msgid "Remove a file. This is an alias for :func:`remove`."
msgstr "Menghapus file. Ini adalah alias untuk :func:`remove`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:90
msgid "Remove a directory."
msgstr "Menghapus direktori."

#: ../../library/os.rst:94
msgid "Rename a file."
msgstr "Mengganti nama file."

#: ../../library/os.rst:98
msgid "Get the status of a file or directory."
msgstr "Mendapatkan status file atau direktori."

#: ../../library/os.rst:102
msgid "Get the status of a filesystem."
msgstr "Mendapatkan status filesystem."

#: ../../library/os.rst:104
msgid ""
"Returns a tuple with the filesystem information in the following order:"
msgstr "Mengembalikan tuple dengan informasi filesystem dalam urutan berikut:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:106
msgid "``f_bsize`` -- File system block size"
msgstr "``f_bsize`` -- Ukuran blok sistem file"

#: ../../library/os.rst:107
msgid "``f_frsize`` -- Fragment size"
msgstr "``f_frsize`` -- Ukuran fragmen"

#: ../../library/os.rst:108
msgid "``f_blocks`` -- Size of fs in f_frsize units"
msgstr "``f_blocks`` -- Ukuran fs dalam satuan f_frsize"

#: ../../library/os.rst:109
msgid "``f_bfree`` -- Number of free blocks"
msgstr "``f_bfree`` -- Jumlah blok bebas"

#: ../../library/os.rst:110
msgid "``f_bavail`` -- Number of free blocks for unprivileged users"
msgstr "``f_bavail`` -- Jumlah blok bebas untuk pengguna tanpa hak istimewa"

#: ../../library/os.rst:111
msgid "``f_files`` -- Number of inodes"
msgstr "``f_files`` -- Jumlah inode"

#: ../../library/os.rst:112
msgid "``f_ffree`` -- Number of free inodes"
msgstr "``f_ffree`` -- Jumlah inode bebas"

#: ../../library/os.rst:113
msgid "``f_favail`` -- Number of free inodes for unprivileged users"
msgstr "``f_favail`` -- Jumlah inode bebas untuk pengguna tanpa hak istimewa"

#: ../../library/os.rst:114
msgid "``f_flag`` -- Mount flags"
msgstr "``f_flag`` -- Flag mount"

#: ../../library/os.rst:115
msgid "``f_namemax`` -- Maximum filename length"
msgstr "``f_namemax`` -- Panjang nama file maksimum"

#: ../../library/os.rst:117
msgid ""
"Parameters related to inodes: ``f_files``, ``f_ffree``, ``f_favail`` and the"
" ``f_flag`` parameter may return ``0`` as they can be unavailable in a port-"
"specific implementation."
msgstr ""
"Parameter yang terkait dengan inode: ``f_files``\\ , ``f_ffree``\\ , "
"``f_favail`` dan parameter ``f_flag`` mungkin mengembalikan ``0`` karena "
"mungkin tidak tersedia dalam implementasi spesifik port."

#: ../../library/os.rst:123
msgid "Sync all filesystems."
msgstr "Menyinkronkan semua filesystem."

#: ../../library/os.rst:128
msgid ""
"The path-component separator used by the filesystem, the string ``'/'``."
msgstr ""
"Pemisah komponen jalur yang digunakan oleh filesystem, string ``'/'``\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:131
msgid "Terminal redirection and duplication"
msgstr "Pengalihan dan duplikasi terminal"

#: ../../library/os.rst:135
msgid ""
"Duplicate or switch the MicroPython terminal (the REPL) on the given "
":std:term:`stream`-like object. The *stream_object* argument must be a "
"native stream object, or derive from :class:`io.IOBase` and implement the "
"``readinto()`` and ``write()`` methods.  The stream should be in non-"
"blocking mode and ``readinto()`` should return ``None`` if there is no data "
"available for reading."
msgstr ""
"Menduplikasi atau mengalihkan terminal MicroPython (REPL) pada objek seperti"
" :std:term:`stream` yang diberikan. Argumen *stream_object* harus berupa "
"objek stream native, atau turunan dari :class:`io.IOBase` dan "
"mengimplementasikan metode ``readinto()`` dan ``write()``\\ . Stream harus "
"dalam mode non-blocking dan ``readinto()`` harus mengembalikan ``None`` jika"
" tidak ada data yang tersedia untuk dibaca."

#: ../../library/os.rst:141
msgid ""
"After calling this function all terminal output is repeated on this stream, "
"and any input that is available on the stream is passed on to the terminal "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Setelah memanggil fungsi ini, semua output terminal diulangi pada stream "
"ini, dan input yang tersedia pada stream diteruskan ke input terminal."

#: ../../library/os.rst:144
msgid ""
"The *index* parameter should be a non-negative integer and specifies which "
"duplication slot is set.  A given port may implement more than one slot "
"(slot 0 will always be available) and in that case terminal input and output"
" is duplicated on all the slots that are set."
msgstr ""
"Parameter *index* harus berupa bilangan bulat non-negatif dan menentukan "
"slot duplikasi mana yang ditetapkan. Port tertentu dapat mengimplementasikan"
" lebih dari satu slot (slot 0 akan selalu tersedia) dan dalam kasus tersebut"
" input dan output terminal diduplikasi pada semua slot yang ditetapkan."

#: ../../library/os.rst:149
msgid ""
"If ``None`` is passed as the *stream_object* then duplication is cancelled "
"on the slot given by *index*."
msgstr ""
"Jika ``None`` dilewatkan sebagai *stream_object* maka duplikasi dibatalkan "
"pada slot yang diberikan oleh *index*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:152
msgid ""
"The function returns the previous stream-like object in the given slot."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi mengembalikan objek seperti stream sebelumnya di slot yang diberikan."

#: ../../library/os.rst:156
msgid ""
"Notify the MicroPython REPL that input is available on a stream-like object "
"previously registered via :func:`os.dupterm`."
msgstr ""
"Memberi tahu REPL MicroPython bahwa input tersedia pada objek seperti stream"
" yang sebelumnya didaftarkan melalui :func:`os.dupterm`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:159
msgid ""
"This function should be called by custom stream implementations (e.g., UART,"
" Bluetooth, or other non-USB REPL streams) to inform the REPL that input is "
"ready to be read. Proper use ensures that special characters such as Ctrl+C "
"(used to trigger KeyboardInterrupt) are processed promptly by the REPL, "
"enabling expected interruption behavior for user code."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini harus dipanggil oleh implementasi stream kustom (misalnya, UART, "
"Bluetooth, atau stream REPL non-USB lainnya) untuk memberi tahu REPL bahwa "
"input siap dibaca. Penggunaan yang tepat memastikan bahwa karakter khusus "
"seperti Ctrl+C (digunakan untuk memicu KeyboardInterrupt) diproses segera "
"oleh REPL, memungkinkan perilaku interupsi yang diharapkan untuk kode "
"pengguna."

#: ../../library/os.rst:165
msgid ""
"The *obj_in* parameter is ignored by :func:`os.dupterm_notify`, but is "
"required to allow calling dupterm_notify from an interrupt handler such as "
"`UART.irq()`."
msgstr ""
"Parameter *obj_in* diabaikan oleh :func:`os.dupterm_notify`\\ , tetapi "
"diperlukan untuk mengizinkan pemanggilan dupterm_notify dari penangan "
"interupsi seperti `UART.irq()`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:168
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Contoh:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:179
msgid ""
"If the ``dupterm_notify()`` function is not called, input from the custom "
"stream may not be detected or processed until the next REPL poll, "
"potentially delaying KeyboardInterrupts or other control signals. This is "
"especially important for UART, Bluetooth and other non-standard REPL "
"connections, where automatic notification is not guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"Jika fungsi ``dupterm_notify()`` tidak dipanggil, input dari stream kustom "
"mungkin tidak terdeteksi atau diproses hingga polling REPL berikutnya, yang "
"berpotensi menunda KeyboardInterrupt atau sinyal kontrol lainnya. Ini sangat"
" penting untuk UART, Bluetooth, dan koneksi REPL non-standar lainnya, di "
"mana notifikasi otomatis tidak dijamin."

#: ../../library/os.rst:186
msgid "Filesystem mounting"
msgstr "Pemasangan filesystem"

#: ../../library/os.rst:188
msgid ""
"The following functions and classes have been moved to the :mod:`vfs` "
"module. They are provided in this module only for backwards compatibility "
"and will be removed in version 2 of MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi dan kelas berikut telah dipindahkan ke modul :mod:`vfs`\\ . Mereka "
"disediakan dalam modul ini hanya untuk kompatibilitas mundur dan akan "
"dihapus di versi 2 MicroPython."

#: ../../library/os.rst:194
msgid ""
"Mount the filesystem object *fsobj* at the location in the VFS given by the "
"*mount_point* string.  *fsobj* can be a VFS object that has a ``mount()`` "
"method, or a block device.  If it's a block device then the filesystem type "
"is automatically detected (an exception is raised if no filesystem was "
"recognised).  *mount_point* may be ``'/'`` to mount *fsobj* at the root, or "
"``'/<name>'`` to mount it at a subdirectory under the root."
msgstr ""
"Memasang objek filesystem *fsobj* di lokasi dalam VFS yang diberikan oleh "
"string *mount_point*\\ . *fsobj* dapat berupa objek VFS yang memiliki metode"
" ``mount()``\\ , atau perangkat blok. Jika itu adalah perangkat blok maka "
"jenis filesystem secara otomatis terdeteksi (pengecualian dilempar jika "
"tidak ada filesystem yang dikenali). *mount_point* mungkin ``'/'`` untuk "
"memasang *fsobj* di root, atau ``'/<name>'`` untuk memasangnya di "
"subdirektori di bawah root."

#: ../../library/os.rst:201
msgid "If *readonly* is ``True`` then the filesystem is mounted read-only."
msgstr "Jika *readonly* adalah ``True`` maka filesystem dipasang hanya-baca."

#: ../../library/os.rst:203
msgid ""
"During the mount process the method ``mount()`` is called on the filesystem "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Selama proses pemasangan, metode ``mount()`` dipanggil pada objek "
"filesystem."

#: ../../library/os.rst:206
msgid "Will raise ``OSError(EPERM)`` if *mount_point* is already mounted."
msgstr "Akan melempar ``OSError(EPERM)`` jika *mount_point* sudah dipasang."

#: ../../library/os.rst:211
msgid ""
"With no arguments to :func:`mount`, return a list of tuples representing all"
" active mountpoints."
msgstr ""
"Tanpa argumen untuk :func:`mount`\\ , mengembalikan daftar tuple yang "
"mewakili semua mount point aktif."

#: ../../library/os.rst:214
msgid "The returned list has the form *[(fsobj, mount_point), ...]*."
msgstr ""
"Daftar yang dikembalikan memiliki bentuk *[(fsobj, mount_point), ...]*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:218
msgid ""
"Unmount a filesystem. *mount_point* can be a string naming the mount "
"location, or a previously-mounted filesystem object.  During the unmount "
"process the method ``umount()`` is called on the filesystem object."
msgstr ""
"Melepas filesystem. *mount_point* dapat berupa string yang menamai lokasi "
"mount, atau objek filesystem yang sebelumnya dipasang. Selama proses "
"pelepasan, metode ``umount()`` dipanggil pada objek filesystem."

#: ../../library/os.rst:222
msgid "Will raise ``OSError(EINVAL)`` if *mount_point* is not found."
msgstr "Akan melempar ``OSError(EINVAL)`` jika *mount_point* tidak ditemukan."

#: ../../library/os.rst:226
msgid ""
"Create a filesystem object that uses the FAT filesystem format.  Storage of "
"the FAT filesystem is provided by *block_dev*. Objects created by this "
"constructor can be mounted using :func:`mount`."
msgstr ""
"Membuat objek filesystem yang menggunakan format filesystem FAT. Penyimpanan"
" filesystem FAT disediakan oleh *block_dev*\\ . Objek yang dibuat oleh "
"konstruktor ini dapat dipasang menggunakan :func:`mount`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:232
msgid "Build a FAT filesystem on *block_dev*."
msgstr "Membangun filesystem FAT pada *block_dev*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:236
msgid ""
"Create a filesystem object that accesses the host POSIX filesystem. If "
"*root* is specified then it should be a path in the host filesystem to use "
"as the root of the ``VfsPosix`` object.  Otherwise the current directory of "
"the host filesystem is used."
msgstr ""
"Membuat objek filesystem yang mengakses filesystem POSIX host. Jika *root* "
"ditentukan maka harus berupa jalur dalam filesystem host yang digunakan "
"sebagai root objek ``VfsPosix``\\ . Jika tidak, direktori saat ini dari "
"filesystem host digunakan."

#: ../../library/os.rst:241
msgid ""
"``VfsPosix`` is only available on the Unix port; it is not present on the "
"OpenMV Cam."
msgstr "``VfsPosix`` hanya tersedia pada port Unix; tidak ada di OpenMV Cam."
